<speak>I like the idea of keeping my comments separate. I've sometimes written on a printed page and later wondered whether a note came from me or was part of the original. Nothing dramatic, just a question mark beside a sentence that I then couldn't explain. A separate notebook would be cleaner. For the renovation, my wife is already doing that: correspondence in one folder, our questions in another. I used to think that was a little fussy, but after searching through my own papers, I'm coming round to her method.</speak>